# libFuzzer writes discovered inputs back to the corpus directory at
# runtime.  We keep the directory structure tracked (each subdirectory
# carries a .gitkeep marker) but not the contents — operators with a
# curated seed corpus to commit can override per their own conventions
# (negate the entries they want to track).

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*/
*/*
!*/.gitkeep
